{"id":"emocio_n","lemma":"emoción","pos":"noun","rank":1988,"glosses":["emotion (person's internal state of being)","excitement"],"ipa":"/emoˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"emociones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-emoci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡No te emociones tanto!","en":"Don't get so excited!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455447","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"copy"}]},{"text":"Con toda la emoción, olvidé comer.","en":"In all the excitement, I forgot to eat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585928","words":[{"g":"with"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to forget","l":"olvidar"},{"g":"to eat"}]},{"text":"Ella no puede controlar sus emociones.","en":"She can't control her emotions.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to control, to rein in"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"Sus palabras la hicieron llorar de emoción.","en":"His words moved her to tears.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its, their"},{"g":"word","l":"palabra"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to cry, to weep"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Tom tiene control sobre sus emociones.","en":"Tom got a grip on his emotions.","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"control"},{"g":"envelope"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]}]}